Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:10:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(usage): share the /usage balance fetch with the
 status chip

DeepSeek and Moonshot balance fetching and parsing now live in one
place (`usage::balance`) and return both the rows /usage renders and the
numeric amount the chip shows, so the two surfaces cannot disagree and
the endpoint is only implemented once.
